WEBVTT

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:11.400
Watch out!

00:00:11.400 --> 00:00:12.200
Ichigo!

00:00:20.160 --> 00:00:21.200
Hang in there, Ichigo.

00:00:21.870 --> 00:00:27.750
I’m sorry, Shirogane. My voice doesn’t
seem to reach Aoyama-kun anymore.

00:00:29.370 --> 00:00:30.340
It will reach.

00:00:31.210 --> 00:00:33.800
You are the chosen super ladies.

00:00:34.630 --> 00:00:37.390
You becoming Mew Strawberry wasn’t an accident.

00:00:38.050 --> 00:00:40.290
You meeting Aoyama,

00:00:40.290 --> 00:00:44.520
and the arrival of the Blue Knight to protect you, also wasn’t an accident.

00:00:44.520 --> 00:00:49.400
Aoyama-kun, in order to protect
the Earth you loved so much,

00:00:56.530 --> 00:01:00.450
I will fight you with everything I have.

00:01:14.630 --> 00:01:16.890
Reborn Mint Echo!

00:01:17.340 --> 00:01:19.850
Reborn Lettuce Rush!

00:01:20.010 --> 00:01:22.470
Reborn PuddingRings Inferno!

00:01:23.090 --> 00:01:25.100
Reborn Pomegran’ Spear!

00:01:29.600 --> 00:01:30.560
Everyone.

00:01:36.150 --> 00:01:38.070
We did it!

00:01:39.320 --> 00:01:42.620
That’s fine. Playtime is now over.

00:01:54.210 --> 00:01:55.920
What is that?

00:02:05.060 --> 00:02:09.480
It seems I got too fired up
fighting weaklings.

00:02:10.270 --> 00:02:11.020
Pie.

00:02:11.560 --> 00:02:12.230
Yes.

00:02:12.620 --> 00:02:14.190
I leave the rest to you.

00:02:14.190 --> 00:02:15.570
I understand.

00:02:19.730 --> 00:02:20.700
Wait!

00:02:20.700 --> 00:02:22.620
Kuu Rai Sen!

00:02:26.700 --> 00:02:27.920
I have to get over there.

00:02:30.160 --> 00:02:33.250
No matter what,
I have to get over there.

00:02:33.990 --> 00:02:39.760
People such as you can’t do anything
to stop Deep Blue-sama from now on.

00:02:39.760 --> 00:02:40.920
Stop him?

00:02:40.920 --> 00:02:42.260
What is going on?

00:02:44.840 --> 00:02:45.640
This is...

00:02:49.930 --> 00:02:51.470
<i>Everyone, can you hear me?</i>

00:02:51.470 --> 00:02:53.180
<i>The reaction has appeared.</i>

00:02:53.180 --> 00:02:57.150
<i>It seems like the final Mew Aqua is inside that base.</i>

00:02:57.810 --> 00:02:58.570
What?!

00:02:59.900 --> 00:03:00.990
Inside that?

00:03:01.320 --> 00:03:02.450
What did you say?

00:03:03.060 --> 00:03:08.030
That base is most likely something that was
left on Earth by the aliens in ancient times.

00:03:08.030 --> 00:03:12.920
For some reason, they sealed the
final Mew Aqua inside of it.

00:03:13.500 --> 00:03:14.920
No way!

00:03:14.920 --> 00:03:16.540
I see.

00:03:16.540 --> 00:03:20.050
Pie, what is Deep Blue planning?

00:03:20.800 --> 00:03:23.560
Deep Blue has told me:

00:03:23.560 --> 00:03:25.720
That palace is the final weapon.

00:03:26.340 --> 00:03:29.510
That system will magnify his power.

00:03:29.510 --> 00:03:31.850
The entire planet will be targeted.

00:03:31.850 --> 00:03:33.350
What did you say?

00:03:33.350 --> 00:03:38.570
If you do that, not only Tokyo, but
the Earth will also be destroyed.

00:03:39.480 --> 00:03:45.040
The palace has risen from inside the Mew Aqua’s reaction.

00:03:45.490 --> 00:03:49.000
It has appeared as Deep Blue has said.

00:03:49.000 --> 00:03:51.960
The palace’s system is
the final Mew Aqua!

00:03:52.290 --> 00:03:54.420
We will never let that happen!

00:03:55.160 --> 00:03:56.630
Just as Ichigo said.

00:03:57.050 --> 00:04:00.090
We still haven’t been defeated.

00:04:00.380 --> 00:04:02.300
I want to protect everyone.

00:04:02.730 --> 00:04:07.000
The Earth isn’t anyone’s possession.
It belongs to everyone.

00:04:07.630 --> 00:04:08.970
Everyone.

00:04:08.970 --> 00:04:10.680
Mew Strawberry.

00:04:12.410 --> 00:04:13.140
Let’s go!

00:04:14.850 --> 00:04:16.520
I won’t allow it!

00:04:17.980 --> 00:04:19.390
FUSION!

00:04:23.020 --> 00:04:24.780
That Chimera Anima is...

00:04:43.250 --> 00:04:46.640
We are Deep Blue-sama’s
faithful servants!

00:04:47.260 --> 00:04:50.510
We will not allow you inside!

00:04:50.510 --> 00:04:52.270
Kuu Rai Sen Puu Jin!

00:04:57.440 --> 00:04:58.110
It’s coming.

00:05:03.860 --> 00:05:07.530
Reborn Lettuce Rush!

00:05:12.280 --> 00:05:13.120
Now!

00:05:13.120 --> 00:05:14.280
I know.

00:05:14.280 --> 00:05:15.830
Understood.

00:05:17.120 --> 00:05:20.210
Ichigo-san, hurry up and
go to the base.

00:05:22.420 --> 00:05:23.510
Everyone...

00:05:27.130 --> 00:05:28.970
I told you I won’t allow you to go!

00:05:32.720 --> 00:05:34.230
Ichigo, hurry!

00:05:36.350 --> 00:05:37.940
I won’t allow it!

00:05:43.750 --> 00:05:45.490
Ichigo, hurry up and go.

00:05:45.490 --> 00:05:47.200
Tart, damn you!

00:05:47.200 --> 00:05:50.160
I... I don’t like it anymore.

00:05:50.820 --> 00:05:54.750
I don’t like fighting them anymore!

00:05:56.450 --> 00:05:57.540
Foolish.

00:06:05.130 --> 00:06:06.090
Pie.

00:06:07.130 --> 00:06:09.520
It would be good if you have
a nice dream.

00:06:09.520 --> 00:06:11.100
An eternal dream.

00:06:13.720 --> 00:06:14.770
Taru-taru!

00:06:25.230 --> 00:06:27.190
TART!

00:06:27.950 --> 00:06:29.780
Ichigo, leave the rest to us!

00:06:48.040 --> 00:06:50.550
Everyone, stay safe.

00:07:04.850 --> 00:07:06.990
That’s how it was!

00:07:07.690 --> 00:07:09.990
I was foolish for not realizing this earlier.

00:07:29.250 --> 00:07:30.300
I feel it.

00:07:31.210 --> 00:07:35.830
It’s like a warm, nostalgic, and strong power.

00:07:35.830 --> 00:07:37.020
Mew Aqua?

00:07:38.890 --> 00:07:42.310
Aoyama-kun, I know.

00:07:43.100 --> 00:07:48.860
You really love this planet with all
your heart and want to protect it.

00:07:49.270 --> 00:07:52.820
I, I believe in you.

00:07:53.430 --> 00:07:56.530
I can see your smile once more.

00:07:57.150 --> 00:07:59.950
This battle is certainly the final one.

00:07:59.950 --> 00:08:03.000
This battle will decide everything!

00:08:15.130 --> 00:08:17.210
I told you before, didn’t I?

00:08:17.210 --> 00:08:21.020
Fighting is less fun than
playing as friends.

00:08:21.020 --> 00:08:24.480
Even though I said it many,
many times...

00:08:24.810 --> 00:08:27.150
WHY DID <i>THIS</i> HAPPEN?!

00:08:30.690 --> 00:08:33.690
Only tragedy can be born from fighting.

00:08:33.690 --> 00:08:36.160
You still don’t understand?

00:08:36.810 --> 00:08:40.660
If we had been born in a different era...

00:08:41.450 --> 00:08:43.540
No, that’s a joke.

00:08:44.490 --> 00:08:50.380
Even if the fight is meaningless,
this is the mission I was given!

00:08:52.380 --> 00:08:54.590
That’s really unfortunate.

00:08:54.590 --> 00:08:58.600
But if it’s your mission
to continue fighting,

00:08:58.600 --> 00:09:02.180
then it is our mission to continue protecting this planet.

00:09:02.180 --> 00:09:05.650
If it’s for that reason,
we will keep fighting too!

00:09:06.180 --> 00:09:07.520
That’s fine.

00:09:07.520 --> 00:09:12.030
Just a single Earthling who has entered
the palace can’t do anything.

00:09:12.860 --> 00:09:15.650
Why don’t we fulfill our missions together right here?

00:09:15.650 --> 00:09:17.330
Until the end of the end!

00:09:17.820 --> 00:09:19.200
Go, Chimera Anima!

00:09:23.620 --> 00:09:24.740
I won’t forgive you!

00:09:24.740 --> 00:09:26.620
I absolutely won’t forgive you!

00:09:27.360 --> 00:09:30.630
You’ve turned us into your enemies.
We’ll make you regret it!

00:09:36.830 --> 00:09:37.800
I feel it.

00:09:39.250 --> 00:09:40.720
Over there.

00:09:53.480 --> 00:09:55.740
I’m positive it’s up there.

00:10:05.260 --> 00:10:07.500
The Mew Aqua is real close.

00:10:44.450 --> 00:10:45.540
Aoyama-kun!

00:11:31.860 --> 00:11:36.170
This base <i>is</i> the final Mew Aqua?

00:11:36.170 --> 00:11:39.270
Why can you calmly destroy it?

00:11:39.270 --> 00:11:40.810
That’s fine.

00:11:40.810 --> 00:11:44.140
This grandiose place is no longer necessary.

00:11:47.680 --> 00:11:48.350
Scatter!

00:11:51.650 --> 00:11:52.690
Shirogane-san!

00:11:56.580 --> 00:11:57.480
Retasu.

00:12:02.880 --> 00:12:04.460
Retasu-oneechan!

00:12:04.460 --> 00:12:05.160
Retasu...

00:12:07.550 --> 00:12:08.290
Retasu.

00:12:08.920 --> 00:12:11.730
Shirogane-san, are you alright?

00:12:16.100 --> 00:12:18.230
Bu-Ling, take care of Retasu
and the others.

00:12:18.230 --> 00:12:19.480
I’ll do it.

00:12:20.440 --> 00:12:22.970
Oneesama, let’s settle this.

00:12:25.570 --> 00:12:27.400
I won’t forgive you...

00:12:27.400 --> 00:12:30.040
...no matter what reason you have!

00:12:32.210 --> 00:12:34.690
In this fight, reason isn’t necessary!

00:12:35.910 --> 00:12:39.050
Reborn Mint Echo!

00:12:47.550 --> 00:12:50.280
Reborn Pomegran’ Spear!

00:12:58.520 --> 00:13:00.120
You said “no longer necessary.”

00:13:00.120 --> 00:13:01.340
What are you talking about?

00:13:01.690 --> 00:13:04.270
I have no reason to explain it.

00:13:04.270 --> 00:13:06.020
I am invincible.

00:13:06.020 --> 00:13:07.550
That’s all you need to know.

00:13:09.900 --> 00:13:15.080
Almighty as I am, I can not be defeated
by a pathetic Earthling.

00:13:17.410 --> 00:13:22.460
This beautiful planet belongs to me.
It is solely mine.

00:13:22.460 --> 00:13:24.900
I won’t allow anyone else to touch it!

00:13:24.900 --> 00:13:26.110
Aoyama-kun!

00:13:28.090 --> 00:13:30.080
Please wait, Deep Blue-sama.

00:13:30.080 --> 00:13:31.030
Quiche?

00:13:32.220 --> 00:13:34.800
What is it, useless one?

00:13:34.800 --> 00:13:35.620
Get out of my sight!

00:13:36.350 --> 00:13:41.290
Deep Blue-sama, please accept my deep apologies for the many disrespects until now.

00:13:47.120 --> 00:13:48.470
Quiche?

00:13:48.470 --> 00:13:51.030
In order to atone...

00:13:51.030 --> 00:13:53.750
...watch as I end the life of this Earthling.

00:13:56.120 --> 00:13:58.480
Please lay down your arms.

00:13:58.480 --> 00:14:02.150
Earthlings aren’t worth troubling yourself with.

00:14:03.200 --> 00:14:05.710
You’re asking forgiveness from me?

00:14:05.710 --> 00:14:06.510
Yes.

00:14:07.170 --> 00:14:10.550
Everything on this planet belongs to Deep Blue-sama.

00:14:10.550 --> 00:14:11.270
However...

00:14:14.550 --> 00:14:15.370
You!

00:14:15.780 --> 00:14:18.760
You have been driven by your own
greed and become careless.

00:14:18.760 --> 00:14:22.100
All you want is to make this planet your own.

00:14:22.100 --> 00:14:24.800
You never planned to use this power
to save my home planet.

00:14:26.600 --> 00:14:29.690
If you really want Earth this badly, go right ahead.

00:14:29.690 --> 00:14:33.680
But I will never allow you to have Ichigo!

00:14:35.640 --> 00:14:38.350
In the end, you plan to oppose me?

00:14:38.670 --> 00:14:39.670
That’s right.

00:14:40.330 --> 00:14:41.400
DIE!

00:14:47.000 --> 00:14:49.090
I lost.

00:14:53.090 --> 00:14:54.020
QUICHE!

00:14:59.550 --> 00:15:00.520
Quiche.

00:15:02.810 --> 00:15:06.900
I guess I was lucky to have this time with you.

00:15:07.690 --> 00:15:08.670
Ichigo.

00:15:12.070 --> 00:15:14.600
Are you crying, Ichigo?

00:15:16.900 --> 00:15:18.960
<i>It’s been a while, kitty!</i>

00:15:22.160 --> 00:15:23.520
<i>Ichigo is mine!</i>

00:15:26.120 --> 00:15:28.940
<i>Alright... Then I’ll go alone.</i>

00:15:31.990 --> 00:15:35.680
Ichigo, I’ll teach you something good.

00:15:37.970 --> 00:15:39.040
Quiche.

00:15:49.980 --> 00:15:53.800
Quiche!

00:15:54.420 --> 00:15:57.770
Reborn Mint Echo!

00:16:03.310 --> 00:16:04.900
Kuu Rai Sen!

00:16:04.900 --> 00:16:06.860
Reborn Pomegran’ Spear!

00:16:21.550 --> 00:16:25.930
Aoyama-kun, I’ve made a resolution.

00:16:25.930 --> 00:16:28.380
I will fight you with everything I have...

00:16:28.700 --> 00:16:32.800
...because I want to see your smile one more time,

00:16:33.110 --> 00:16:35.070
...because I believe in you!

00:16:36.360 --> 00:16:41.450
But I can’t allow you
to hurt anyone else.

00:16:54.020 --> 00:16:56.700
I just can’t see your smile again!

00:16:57.830 --> 00:16:59.310
I just can’t!

00:17:07.580 --> 00:17:12.550
That’s right, I can’t... Aoyama-kun...

00:17:38.990 --> 00:17:39.740
That’s...

00:17:52.810 --> 00:17:54.310
Minto, we’ll go save them.

00:17:54.310 --> 00:17:55.190
Right.

00:18:11.950 --> 00:18:15.420
<i>Originally, you lived on Earth.</i>

00:18:15.420 --> 00:18:18.590
<i>Then you are our friends, aren’t you?</i>

00:18:22.720 --> 00:18:27.310
Soon... might it be time for me to dream as well?

00:18:30.930 --> 00:18:32.840
KUU RAI SEN PUU JIN!

00:19:09.180 --> 00:19:11.290
He saved us?

00:19:12.470 --> 00:19:14.610
I can’t move.

00:19:15.520 --> 00:19:18.570
We’ve done all we can until now.

00:19:19.480 --> 00:19:21.280
Please, Ichigo.

00:19:22.070 --> 00:19:26.200
The rest is up to you,
you must protect the Earth...

00:20:00.480 --> 00:20:02.050
I... chi... go...

00:20:11.990 --> 00:20:13.230
Ichigo.

00:20:14.540 --> 00:20:16.210
Aoyama-kun.

00:20:25.050 --> 00:20:28.600
Love is shapeless and uncertain.

00:20:29.220 --> 00:20:34.270
But these deep bonds become a strong weapon that can’t be defeated by anything.

00:20:35.640 --> 00:20:40.930
This deep affection from the heart becomes
a power that can save one from anything.

00:20:42.300 --> 00:20:47.780
Finally, the love that she’s staked her
life on, will be concluded here.

00:20:48.610 --> 00:20:53.410
Ichigo, thank you for everything.
